              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"1e05ed4ef0815cedc4bde96d86880ce8803e8c6d3c5d0f19296fc66c8f563a92\" kind=\"text\" label=\"invoice evidence\">\nINVOICE\n\nFrom: Lira Velan\nLocation: Philippines\nTo: Mara\nIssued: 3 June 2026\n\nMobile app UI design\nThree mobile app UI screens in an editable design file: EUR 480\nPDF preview: included\nOne revision round: included\n\nTotal due: EUR 480\nPayment method: PayPal\nPayment due: 10 June 2026\nFinal files due: 18 June 2026\n\nScope covers the home screen, daily check-in screen, and progress screen described in the buyer brief. Development, coding, and app-store submission are not included. The buyer may send consolidated feedback on the preview for the included revision round. This invoice is for the agreed design fee and does not record payment.\n</evidence>"
